<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Asosiy Sahifa</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0b0e14;
            --bg-soft: #101522;
            --card: #0f172a;
            --text: #e5e7eb;
            --muted: #9ca3af;
            --brand: #7c3aed;
            --brand-2: #22d3ee;
            --ring: rgba(124,58,237,.35);
            --radius: 16px;
            --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
            --glass: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0
        }

        html, body {
            height: 100%;
        }

        body {
            font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans", "Liberation Sans", sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%, rgba(124,58,237,.18), transparent 40%), radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 90% 0%, rgba(34,211,238,.14), transparent 40%), linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), #0a0c13 60%);
            color: var(--text);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }

        .media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
            : root

        {
            --bg: #f6f7fb;
            --bg-soft: #eef0f7;
            --card: #ffffff;
            --text: #0b1220;
            --muted: #5b6471;
            --ring: rgba(124,58,237,.25);
            --glass: rgba(0,0,0,.04);
        }

        body {
            background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%, rgba(124,58,237,.10), transparent 40%), radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 90% 0%, rgba(34,211,238,.10), transparent 40%), linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg), #ffffff 60%);
        }

        }

        .container {
            width: min(1150px, 92%);
            margin-inline: auto;
        }

        /* ====== Top Nav ====== */
        .nav {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 50;
            backdrop-filter: saturate(150%) blur(10px);
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--glass), transparent);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
        }

            .nav .inner {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                padding: 14px 0;
            }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: .2px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-grid;
            place-items: center;
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-2));
            box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(124,58,237,.35)
        }

        .brand span {
            font-size: 1.05rem
        }

        .menu {
            display: flex;
            gap: 18px;
        }

            .menu a {
                color: var(--text);
                text-decoration: none;
                font-size: .95rem;
                padding: 8px 12px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                transition: all .2s
            }

                .menu a:hover {
                    background: rgba(255,255,255,.06)
                }

        .cta {
            padding: 9px 14px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-2));
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px var(--ring);
            text-decoration: none
        }

        /* ====== Hero ====== */
        .hero {
            position: relative;
            padding: 72px 0 48px;
        }

            .hero .grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
                gap: 36px;
                align-items: center
            }

        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-flex;
            gap: 8px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 6px 10px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: .85rem;
            background: var(--glass)
        }

            .eyebrow .dot {
                width: 8px;
                height: 8px;
                border-radius: 999px;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-2))
            }

        .hero h1 {
            margin-top: 14px;
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
            line-height: 1.1
        }

        .hero p {
            margin-top: 14px;
            color: var(--muted);
            max-width: 56ch
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 22px
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
            background: var(--glass);
            color: var(--text)
        }

            .btn.primary {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-2));
                color: #fff;
                border-color: transparent;
                box-shadow: 0 10px 20px var(--ring)
            }

        /* Hero Card */
        .hero-card {
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            padding: 22px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden
        }

            .hero-card:before {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                inset: -1px;
                background: conic-gradient(from 180deg at 50% 50%, rgba(124,58,237,.18), rgba(34,211,238,.18), transparent 30%);
                filter: blur(24px);
                opacity: .55;
                z-index: 0
            }

            .hero-card .kpi {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 1;
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
                gap: 12px
            }

        .metric {
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)
        }

            .metric b {
                font-size: 1.35rem
            }

            .metric span {
                display: block;
                color: var(--muted);
                font-size: .9rem;
                margin-top: 4px
            }

        .section {
            padding: 48px 0
        }

            .section .head {
                display: flex;
                align-items: end;
                justify-content: space-between;
                margin-bottom: 18px
            }

            .section h2 {
                font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem)
            }

        .sub {
            color: var(--muted)
        }

        .grid-3 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
            gap: 18px
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 18px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            transition: transform .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease, border-color .2s
        }

            .card:hover {
                transform: translateY(-4px);
                box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
                border-color: rgba(124,58,237,.35)
            }

            .card .icon {
                width: 42px;
                height: 42px;
                border-radius: 12px;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), var(--brand-2));
                display: grid;
                place-items: center;
                margin-bottom: 10px
            }

            .card h3 {
                font-size: 1.05rem;
                margin-bottom: 8px
            }

            .card p {
                color: var(--muted);
                font-size: .95rem
            }

        .stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 10px
        }

        .pill {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            text-align: center
        }

            .pill b {
                font-size: 1.1rem
            }

            .pill span {
                display: block;
                color: var(--muted);
                font-size: .85rem
            }

        .cta-wrap {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(124,58,237,.10), rgba(34,211,238,.10));
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
            border-radius: calc(var(--radius) + 8px);
            padding: 22px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 18px
        }

            .cta-wrap p {
                color: var(--muted)
            }

        footer {
            padding: 26px 0;
            color: var(--muted);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
            margin-top: 36px
        }

        .media (max-width: 900px) {
            .hero .grid

        {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr
        }

        .grid-3 {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr
        }

        .stats {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr
        }

        .nav .inner {
            gap: 12px
        }

        .menu {
            display: none
        }

        }
        .media (max-width: 560px) {
            .grid-3

        {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr
        }

        .stats {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr
        }

        .hero-actions {
            flex-direction: column
        }

        }


        50% {
            transform: translateY(-6px)
        }

        100% {
            transform: translateY(0)
        }

        }

        .badge {
            animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="nav">
        <div class="container inner">
            <div class="brand">
                <div class="badge">📊</div>
                <span>IqtisodiyStat</span>
            </div>
            <div class="menu">
                <a asp-controller="Real" asp-action="UnemploymentView">Unempleyee</a>
                <a asp-controller="Real" asp-action="TradeView">Trade</a>
                <a asp-controller="Real" asp-action="SectorView">Sector</a>
                <a asp-controller="Real" asp-action="InflationView">Infation</a>
                <a asp-controller="Real" asp-action="GdpView">YAIM</a>
                <a asp-controller="Real" asp-action="DemographyView">Demography</a>
                <a asp-controller="Real" asp-action="CurrencyRateView">CurrencyRate</a>
                <a asp-controller="Real" asp-action="BudgetView">Budget</a>
                <a asp-controller="Real" asp-action="DemographyGenderView">DemographyGender</a>
            </div>
            <a class="cta" href="#boshlash">Boshlash</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero">
        <div class="container grid">
            <div>
                <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Iqtisodiy va ijtimoiy ko‘rsatkichlar</div>
                <h1>O‘zbekiston iqtisodiyoti raqamlar orqali</h1>
                <p>YaIM, inflyatsiya, ishsizlik, demografiya va boshqa muhim ko‘rsatkichlarni tahlil qiling.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                     <a class="btn primary" href="#boshlash">Boshlash</a>
                     <a class="btn" href="#xususiyatlar">Ko‘proq ma’lumot</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <aside class="hero-card">
                <div class="kpi">
                    <div class="metric">
                        <b>6.1%</b>
                        <span>YaIM o‘sishi (2024)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric">
                        <b>9.4%</b>
                        <span>Inflyatsiya (2024)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="metric">
                        <b>4.8%</b>
                        <span>Ishsizlik darajasi</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section id="xususiyatlar" class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="head">
                <div>
                    <h2>Asosiy ko‘rsatkichlar</h2>
                    <p class="sub">Iqtisodiy rivojlanishning muhim elementlari.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid-3">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon">💰</div>
                    <h3>YaIM</h3>
                    <p>O‘zbekiston yalpi ichki mahsulot hajmining yillik o‘sishi.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon">📈</div>
                    <h3>Inflyatsiya</h3>
                    <p>Milliy valyutadagi narxlar o‘sishi darajasi.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="icon">👷</div>
                    <h3>Ishsizlik</h3>
                    <p>Bandlik va mehnat bozoridagi asosiy ko‘rsatkichlar.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="stat" class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="head">
                <h2>Qisqa Statistika</h2>
                <p class="sub">O‘zbekiston iqtisodiy va ijtimoiy holatining soddalashtirilgan ko‘rinishi.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="stats">
                <div class="pill"><b>36 mln</b><span>Aholi soni</span></div>
                <div class="pill"><b>65%</b><span>Shahar aholisi</span></div>
                <div class="pill"><b>$18 mlrd</b><span>Eksport hajmi</span></div>
                <div class="pill"><b>$25 mlrd</b><span>Import hajmi</span></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container cta-wrap" id="boshlash">
            <div>
                <h3>Iqtisodiy tahlilni bugunoq boshlang</h3>
                <p>Yalpi ichki mahsulot, byudjet xarajatlari, savdo balansi va boshqa ko‘rsatkichlarni real vaqt rejimida kuzating.</p>
            </div>
            <a class="cta" href="#boglanish">Ulanish</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <div class="container" id="boglanish">
            <small>© 2025 IqtisodiyStat. Barcha huquqlar himoyalangan.</small>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>
